<section class="section mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-16 lg:px-10"><p class="eyebrow text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.22em] text-accent">আমাদের সঙ্গে যোগাযোগ করুন</p><h1 class="font-display [overflow-wrap:anywhere] my-5 text-5xl">আপনার কথা শুনতে চাই।</h1><div class="mt-10 grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-3"><aside><h2 class="font-display [overflow-wrap:anywhere] text-3xl">চলে আসুন আমাদের ঠিকানায়।</h2><p class="my-6 whitespace-pre-line text-stone-600"><?= rich_inline(setting('contact.address')) ?></p><p><?= e(setting('contact.phone')) ?></p><p><?= e(
    setting('contact.email'),
) ?></p><p class="mt-6 whitespace-pre-line text-sm leading-7"><?= rich_inline(setting('contact.hours')) ?></p></aside><form class="card rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm space-y-5" method="post" action="/contact"><h2 class="font-display [overflow-wrap:anywhere] text-3xl">বার্তা পাঠান</h2><?= csrf() ?><div class="hidden" aria-hidden="true"><input class="w-full rounded-lg border border-stone-300 bg-white p-3 text-sm text-ink [&[type=checkbox]]:w-auto [&[type=radio]]:w-auto" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></div><label class="block text-sm font-medium">নাম<input class="w-full rounded-lg border border-stone-300 bg-white p-3 text-sm text-ink [&[type=checkbox]]:w-auto [&[type=radio]]:w-auto" name="name" required maxlength="100" autocomplete="name"></label><label class="block text-sm font-medium">ইমেইল<input class="w-full rounded-lg border border-stone-300 bg-white p-3 text-sm text-ink [&[type=checkbox]]:w-auto [&[type=radio]]:w-auto" type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email"></label><label class="block text-sm font-medium">বার্তা<textarea class="w-full rounded-lg border border-stone-300 bg-white p-3 text-sm text-ink" name="message" required maxlength="5000" rows="6"></textarea></label><button class="btn inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-orange-800 disabled:opacity-40">বার্তা পাঠান</button></form><form id="reserve" class="card rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm space-y-4" method="post" action="/reservations"><h2 class="font-display [overflow-wrap:anywhere] text-3xl">টেবিল বুকিং</h2><p class="text-sm text-stone-500">আমাদের দল যোগাযোগ করে নিশ্চিত করার পর বুকিং চূড়ান্ত হবে।</p><?= csrf() ?><div class="hidden" aria-hidden="true"><input class="w-full rounded-lg border border-stone-300 bg-white p-3 text-sm text-ink [&[type=checkbox]]:w-auto [&[type=radio]]:w-auto" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></div><label class="block text-sm font-medium">নাম<input class="w-full rounded-lg border border-stone-300 bg-white p-3 text-sm text-ink [&[type=checkbox]]:w-auto [&[type=radio]]:w-auto" name="name" required maxlength="100"></label><label class="block text-sm font-medium">ইমেইল<input class="w-full rounded-lg border border-stone-300 bg-white p-3 text-sm text-ink [&[type=checkbox]]:w-auto [&[type=radio]]:w-auto" type="email" name="email" required></label><label class="block text-sm font-medium">মোবাইল<input class="w-full rounded-lg border border-stone-300 bg-white p-3 text-sm text-ink [&[type=checkbox]]:w-auto [&[type=radio]]:w-auto" name="phone" type="tel" placeholder="01712345678" required></label><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3"><label class="block text-sm font-medium">তারিখ ও সময়<input class="w-full rounded-lg border border-stone-300 bg-white p-3 text-sm text-ink [&[type=checkbox]]:w-auto [&[type=radio]]:w-auto" type="datetime-local" name="reserved_at" required min="<?= date(
    'Y-m-d\TH:i',
) ?>"></label><label class="block text-sm font-medium">অতিথি সংখ্যা<input class="w-full rounded-lg border border-stone-300 bg-white p-3 text-sm text-ink [&[type=checkbox]]:w-auto [&[type=radio]]:w-auto" type="number" name="guests" value="2" min="1" max="<?= (int) setting(
